# LKML Agent Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph LKML_Agent["LKML Agent Workflow (LangGraph StateGraph)"]
        direction TB

        FETCH["fetch_patch<br/>- b4 am<br/>- Progress bar<br/>- Timeout handling"]
        PARSE["parse_patch<br/>- Extract author<br/>- Extract date<br/>- Extract subject"]
        GEN_SUM["generate_summary<br/>- AI summary<br/>- 300 char limit"]
        ANALYZE["analyze_patch<br/>- AI analysis<br/>- Technical impact<br/>(detail level only)"]
        OUTPUT["output_results<br/>- Markdown table output"]
    end

    subgraph Cache["Disk Cache System"]
        CACHE_DIR["output/lkml/<message-id>/"]
        COVER["<message-id>.cover"]
        MBX["<message-id>.mbx"]
    end

    FETCH --> PARSE --> GEN_SUM --> ANALYZE --> OUTPUT

 OUTPUT --> CACHE_DIR
    CACHE_DIR --> COVER
    CACHE_DIR --> MBX

    style LKML_Agent fill:#fff3e0
    style Cache fill:#e8f5e9
```
